{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48936","headline":"紫薇花 · 唐彦谦","name":"紫薇花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素秋寒露重，芳事固应稀。\n小槛临清沼，高丛见紫薇。\n温{麻/昷}终有思，暗淡岂无辉。\n见欲迷交甫，谁能状宓妃。\n妆新犹倚镜，步缓不胜衣。\n怳似新相得，伥如久未归。\n又疑神女过，犹佩七香帏。\n还似星娥织，初临五彩机。\n庆云今已集，威凤莫惊飞。\n绮笔题难尽，烦君白玉徽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}